223
00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:22.640
Kahjuks peame null andma siin.

224
00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:25.850
Hästi tasu, kaalu, hapusus, magusus,

225
00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:28.460
